\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 2: ghi chi ti\u7871\'3ft t\u7915\'3fng B\u7897\'3f, }{\f52\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \u7883\'3fa ph}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd\'f5}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 
ng, ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn v\'e0 d\u7921\'3f \'e1n.
\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 3, 4: ghi theo quy\u7871\'3ft }{\f52\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \u7883\'3fnh ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft c\u7911\'3fa c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn.
\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 5: ghi theo th\u7901\'3fi gian th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f.
\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 6: k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f s\u7889\'3f v\u7889\'3fn t\u7841\'3fm \u7913\'3fng ch}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 a ho\'e0n t\u7841\'3fm \u7913\'3fng.
