\par + C\'e1c c\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 12, 13, 14, 15, 16: bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f s\u7889\'3f t\u7841\'3fm \u7913\'3fng ch}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 a ho\'e0n tr\u7843\'3f.
\par 2. B\'e1o c\'e1o c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd\u7899\'3f}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 c t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc Trung }{
