\par 2.1. Bi\u7875\'3fu 2A/BC: B\'e1o c\'e1o th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn }{\f52\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \u7847\'3fu t}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529  XDCB h\'e0ng th
\'e1ng:
\par - Th\u7901\'3fi gian b\'e1o c\'e1o: }{\f52\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \u7883\'3fnh k\u7923\'3f h\'e0ng th\'e1ng, ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft v\'e0o ng\'e0y 5 th\'e1ng sau.
\par - C\'e1ch l\u7845\'3fy s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu:
