\u7857\'3fng ng\'e2n s\'e1ch nh\'e0 n}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd\u7899\'3f}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 c do Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd\u7899\'3f}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 c tr\u7921
\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t ho\u7863\'3fc cho vay.
\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 3: ghi theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch Nh\'e0 n}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd\u7899\'3f}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 c giao.
