\par + B\'e1o c\'e1o c\'e1c th\'e1ng 3, 6, 9 chi ti\u7871\'3ft t\u7915\'3fng d\u7921\'3f \'e1n, b\'e1o c\'e1o v\'e0o ng\'e0y 15 th\'e1ng sau.
