\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 12, 13, 15: bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f s\u7889\'3f v\u7889\'3fn t\u7841\'3fm \u7913\'3fng ch}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 a ho\'e0n tr\u7843\'3f.
\par 3. B\'e1o c\'e1o c\u7911\'3fa S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh - V\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 g\u7917\'3fi B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh:
