\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529  XDCB h\'e0ng th\'e1ng:
\par - Th\u7901\'3fi gian b\'e1o c\'e1o: }{\f52\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \u7883\'3fnh k\u7923\'3f h\'e0ng th\'e1ng, ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft v\'e0o ng\'e0y 10 th\'e1ng sau.
\par - C\'e1ch l\u7845\'3fy s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu: chi ti\u7871\'3ft theo t\u7915\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn, ng\'e0nh kinh t\u7871\'3f (ri\'eang b\'e1o c\'e1o th\'e1ng 3, 6, 9 chi ti\u7871\'3ft theo d\u7921\'3f \'e1n).
\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 3: theo k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch Nh\'e0 n}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd\u7899\'3f}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 c giao.
