\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 8, 9, 11: bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f s\u7889\'3f v\u7889\'3fn t\u7841\'3fm \u7913\'3fng ch}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 a ho\'e0n tr\u7843\'3f.
