\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 3, 4: ghi theo quy\u7871\'3ft }{\f52\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn.
