\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 8: ghi theo s\u7889\'3f th\'f4ng b\'e1o c\u7911\'3fa S\u7903\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh - V\u7853\'3ft gi\'e1 (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3).
\par + C\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f 13, 16: bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f s\u7889\'3f v\u7889\'3fn t\u7841\'3fm \u7913\'3fng ch}{\f60\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 \'fd}{\f0\insrsid9193529\charrsid9193529 a ho\'e0n tr\u7843\'3f.
